      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jefferson%E2%80%93Chalmers_Historic_Business_District",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Two early‑20th‑century ballrooms, Monticello and Vanity, still operate and were cultural hubs of the big‑band era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
